Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,My name's Yonas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.10,0:00:02.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,co-founder and CEO at
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.52,0:00:03.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,StarSling.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.78,0:00:05.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,We make your GitHub
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.04,0:00:06.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,actions up to 10x
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.76,0:00:09.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,faster. So we have fast
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.10,0:00:10.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,hardware
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.22,0:00:11.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,like everyone else that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.32,0:00:13.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,does CI, but we also
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.48,0:00:15.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,have AI agents that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.44,0:00:17.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,speed up your CI by
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.28,0:00:19.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,opening up PRs to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.74,0:00:20.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,optimize your tests
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:21.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,make sure you're
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.04,0:00:21.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,sharding
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.64,0:00:22.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,caching properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.71,0:00:24.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,So if anyone out here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.21,0:00:26.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,has slow CI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.27,0:00:27.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,check out StarSling.
